stream
BT
/F2 20 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 762 Tm (Remote and Hybrid Working Policy) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 741.5 Tm (Owner: People Team) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 722.5 Tm (Version: 2.1) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 703.5 Tm (Effective: 1 January 2027) Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 674.0 Tm (1. Purpose) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 658.5 Tm (This policy explains how remote and hybrid working operates at Northfield Components. It) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 644.5 Tm (applies to all employees who have completed their probation period. Employees still in probation) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 630.5 Tm (should work from the office unless their manager agrees otherwise in writing.) Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 601.0 Tm (2. Principles) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 585.5 Tm (We trust people to do their best work where they are most effective. Remote working is a) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 571.5 Tm (privilege that depends on meeting the needs of the business, the team and the customer. It is not a) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 557.5 Tm (contractual right, and the company may withdraw or adjust arrangements with reasonable) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 543.5 Tm (notice.) Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 514.0 Tm (3. Standard arrangements) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 498.5 Tm (Most office-based roles follow a hybrid pattern of at least two days a week in the office. Teams) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 484.5 Tm (should agree which days they will share and must make sure that those days are recorded in the) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 470.5 Tm (team calendar. Roles that depend on equipment or physical presence, such as warehouse and) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 456.5 Tm (production, are not eligible for remote working.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 437.5 Tm (Employees must be available during core hours of 10:00 to 15:00 on working days. Managers) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 423.5 Tm (must agree any changes to core hours in advance.) Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 394.0 Tm (4. Requesting a change) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 378.5 Tm (An employee wishing to change their pattern must submit a request through the HR portal. The) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 364.5 Tm (line manager must respond within ten working days. If the request is declined, the manager must) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 350.5 Tm (give the reasons in writing. Employees may appeal to the head of department within five working) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 336.5 Tm (days of the decision.) Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 307.0 Tm (5. Working from abroad) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 291.5 Tm (Employees must not work from outside the United Kingdom for more than ten days in any) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 277.5 Tm (calendar year without written approval from the People Team. Working abroad can create tax,) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 263.5 Tm (immigration and data protection obligations, and approval will not be given retrospectively.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 249.5 Tm (Requests must be submitted at least six weeks before travel.) Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 220.0 Tm (6. Equipment and expenses) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 204.5 Tm (The company will provide a laptop, monitor and headset to all hybrid employees. Employees are) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 190.5 Tm (responsible for keeping equipment secure and must report loss or theft to IT within 24 hours. A) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 176.5 Tm (home working allowance of £8 per week is paid for each week in which an employee works) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 162.5 Tm (from home for at least three days.) Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 133.0 Tm (7. Information security) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 117.5 Tm (Employees working remotely must use the company VPN when accessing internal systems, lock) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 103.5 Tm (their screens when leaving the device, and never use personal email for company business.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 89.5 Tm (Confidential documents must not be printed at home. Any suspected data breach must be reported) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 75.5 Tm (to the security team immediately.) Tj
ET
