/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 769 Tm (8. Health and safety) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 753.5 Tm (Employees must complete the online display screen equipment assessment within one month of) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 739.5 Tm (starting to work from home and repeat it annually. Managers should hold regular one to one) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 725.5 Tm (conversations about wellbeing and workload.) Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 696.0 Tm (9. Review) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 680.5 Tm (The People Team will review this policy each year. Managers must confirm to the People Team) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 666.5 Tm (by 31 January that all team members have read and accepted it.) Tj
